    "success_condition": "Continue after R-084 at A13-CLASSII-FUTURE-CONTROL-WEIGHTED-INNOVATION-BRACKET. R-079--R-083 give the complete frame-current and safe-packet decomposition, regular low-object absorption, stopped-current FAR square, controlled polynomial support closure, and exact three-Cartan input telescope with coefficient 3/(80P). R-084 diagonalises that Cartan square over complete probability roots and gives an exact conditional far-projected OU-gradient representation retaining coefficient-difference, predictable derivative-injection, and fresh value-innovation channels. Its cumulative-tree no-go proves that root orthogonality or unweighted Gaussian Poincare alone is not one-use; prove the summed production far-projected OU-gradient estimate using spatial paracomposition or another weighted signed cancellation. R-084 also form-absorbs all three linear Pauli--Fierz NEAR rows for regular mutually orthogonal strict-past one-shot controls, with five positive Young slacks and worst random moment 30/7. This does not prove positivity or control the nonlinear rational row. Prove that rational endpoint and recombine it with the linear form bound, conditional covariance defects, complete forest, and paid subtraction. Then prove an overlap-stable bounded-simple complete-packet lower bound and A13-CLASSII-FULL-PROGRESSIVE-REVISIT-EXTENSION. Only after controlled Cartan CFAR, complete signed NEAR, and PROG may controlled-shell one-use and conditional q=10/9 Nelson synthesis be invoked. Sector A remains open."
